Description:It is your second main phase. You have Guttersnipe (whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, it deals 2 damage to each opponent) and two Shocks in hand, with five red mana floating. The opponent is at 8 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-cast-trigger-source-first | A cast trigger works only if its source is on the battlefield when the spell is cast (CR 603.2, 603.6): cast Guttersnipe first, then each Shock deals 2 plus Guttersnipe's 2, 8 in total; a Shock cast before Guttersnipe gets no trigger
